    },
    {
      "id": "c_04",
      "text": "Quiet harbor",
      "position": {
        "x": 720,
        "y": 0
      },
      "color_slot": "slot_green",
      "tags": [],
      "pinned": false,
      "stack_id": null,
      "created_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00",
      "modified_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "c_05",
      "text": "Salt air",
      "position": {
        "x": 960,
        "y": 0
      },
      "color_slot": "slot_pink",
      "tags": [],
      "pinned": false,
      "stack_id": null,
      "created_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00",
      "modified_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "c_06",
      "text": "Driftwood pile",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 160
      },
      "color_slot": "slot_purple",
      "tags": [],
      "pinned": false,
      "stack_id": null,
      "created_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00",
      "modified_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "c_07",
      "text": "The gulls woke her before the alarm ever could.",
      "position": {
        "x": 240,
        "y": 160
      },
      "color_slot": "slot_gray",
      "tags": [],
      "pinned": false,
      "stack_id": null,
      "created_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00",
      "modified_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "c_08",
      "text": "He kept the ship's log in a hand no one else could read.",
      "position": {
        "x": 480,
        "y": 160
      },
      "color_slot": "slot_white",
      "tags": [],
      "pinned": false,
      "stack_id": null,
      "created_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00",
      "modified_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "c_09",
      "text": "A single candle burned in the window past midnight.",
      "position": {
        "x": 720,
        "y": 160
      },
      "color_slot": "slot_yellow",
      "tags": [],
      "pinned": false,
      "stack_id": null,
      "created_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00",
      "modified_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "c_10",
      "text": "The tide pulled back further than anyone could remember.",
      "position": {
        "x": 960,
        "y": 160
      },
      "color_slot": "slot_blue",
      "tags": [],
      "pinned": false,
      "stack_id": null,
      "created_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00",
      "modified_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "c_11",
      "text": "She traded her boots for a pair that actually fit the deck.",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 320
      },
      "color_slot": "slot_green",
      "tags": [],
      "pinned": false,
      "stack_id": null,
      "created_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00",
      "modified_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "c_12",
      "text": "The captain trusted the stars more than any compass aboard.",
      "position": {
        "x": 240,
        "y": 320
      },
      "color_slot": "slot_pink",
      "tags": [],
      "pinned": false,
      "stack_id": null,
      "created_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00",
      "modified_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "c_13",
      "text": "Every low tide leaves something behind that wasn't there before.",
      "position": {
        "x": 480,
        "y": 320
      },
      "color_slot": "slot_purple",
      "tags": [],
      "pinned": false,
      "stack_id": null,
      "created_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00",
      "modified_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "c_14",
      "text": "They say the wreck still rests somewhere past the second reef.",
      "position": {
        "x": 720,
        "y": 320
      },
      "color_slot": "slot_gray",
      "tags": [],
      "pinned": false,
      "stack_id": null,
      "created_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00",
      "modified_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "c_15",
      "text": "The lighthouse keeper hadn't spoken to another soul in three months.",
      "position": {
        "x": 960,
        "y": 320
      },
      "color_slot": "slot_white",
      "tags": [],
      "pinned": false,
      "stack_id": null,
      "created_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00",
      "modified_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "c_16",
      "text": "A storm rolled in from the north just after the market closed for the evening.",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 480
      },
      "color_slot": "slot_yellow",
      "tags": [],
      "pinned": false,
      "stack_id": null,
      "created_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00",
      "modified_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "c_17",
      "text": "The map was torn along its oldest folds, softened by decades of salt and handling.",
      "position": {
        "x": 240,
        "y": 480
      },
      "color_slot": "slot_blue",
      "tags": [],
      "pinned": false,
      "stack_id": null,
      "created_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00",
      "modified_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "c_18",
      "text": "No one could explain why the buoy bell rang on nights with no wind at all.",
      "position": {
        "x": 480,
        "y": 480
      },
      "color_slot": "slot_green",
      "tags": [],
      "pinned": false,
      "stack_id": null,
      "created_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00",
      "modified_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "c_19",
      "text": "The harbor smelled of tar and diesel long before the first boat came into view.",
      "position": {
        "x": 720,
        "y": 480
      },
      "color_slot": "slot_pink",
      "tags": [],
      "pinned": false,
      "stack_id": null,
      "created_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00",
      "modified_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "c_20",
      "text": "He measured the years not in seasons but in how many nets he had patched by hand.",
      "position": {
        "x": 960,
        "y": 480
      },
      "color_slot": "slot_purple",
      "tags": [],
      "pinned": false,
      "stack_id": null,
      "created_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00",
      "modified_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "c_21",
      "text": "The old fisherman repaired his nets by lantern light while the harbor slept quietly around him, sure that tomorrow's catch would finally make it all worthwhile.",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 640
      },
      "color_slot": "slot_gray",
      "tags": [],
      "pinned": false,
      "stack_id": null,
      "created_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00",
      "modified_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "c_22",
      "text": "Every sailor on that long, quiet crossing swore the second lighthouse kept its lamp lit long after the old keeper had died, though none could say who tended it.",
      "position": {
        "x": 240,
        "y": 640
      },
      "color_slot": "slot_white",
      "tags": [],
      "pinned": false,
      "stack_id": null,
      "created_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00",
      "modified_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "c_23",
      "text": "The new deckhand learned quickly that the sea forgives almost nothing twice.",
      "position": {
        "x": 480,
        "y": 640
      },
      "color_slot": "slot_yellow",
      "tags": [],
      "pinned": false,
      "stack_id": null,
      "created_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00",
      "modified_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "c_24",
      "text": "She still keeps the ticket stub from the last ferry that ever crossed that strait.",
      "position": {
        "x": 720,
        "y": 640
      },
      "color_slot": "slot_blue",
      "tags": [],
      "pinned": false,
      "stack_id": null,
      "created_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00",
      "modified_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "c_25",
      "text": "Somewhere below the chart line, the old currents haven't changed in a hundred years.",
      "position": {
        "x": 960,
        "y": 640
      },
      "color_slot": "slot_green",
      "tags": [],
      "pinned": false,
      "stack_id": null,
      "created_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00",
      "modified_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "c_26",
      "text": "Anchor",
      "position": {
        "x": 0.0,
        "y": 860
      },
      "color_slot": "slot_pink",
      "tags": [],
      "pinned": false,
      "stack_id": "s_01",
      "created_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00",
      "modified_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "c_27",
      "text": "Rough waters",
      "position": {
        "x": 0.0,
        "y": 860
      },
      "color_slot": "slot_purple",
      "tags": [],
      "pinned": false,
      "stack_id": "s_01",
      "created_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00",
      "modified_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "c_28",
      "text": "The crew rationed fresh water for the last leg of the voyage.",
      "position": {
        "x": 0.0,
        "y": 860
      },
      "color_slot": "slot_gray",
      "tags": [],
      "pinned": false,
      "stack_id": "s_01",
      "created_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00",
      "modified_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "c_29",
      "text": "No entry was made in the log for the third night of the storm.",
      "position": {
        "x": 0.0,
        "y": 860
      },
      "color_slot": "slot_white",
      "tags": [],
      "pinned": false,
      "stack_id": "s_01",
      "created_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00",
      "modified_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "c_30",
      "text": "The first mate swore the compass had drifted two full degrees overnight.",
      "position": {
        "x": 0.0,
        "y": 860
      },
      "color_slot": "slot_yellow",
      "tags": [],
      "pinned": false,
      "stack_id": "s_01",
      "created_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00",
      "modified_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "c_31",
      "text": "By the time they spotted land, half the crew had stopped believing it was real.",
      "position": {
        "x": 0.0,
        "y": 860
      },
      "color_slot": "slot_blue",
      "tags": [],
      "pinned": false,
      "stack_id": "s_01",
      "created_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00",
      "modified_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "c_32",
      "text": "Shipwreck",
      "position": {
        "x": 400.0,
        "y": 860
      },
      "color_slot": "slot_green",
      "tags": [],
      "pinned": false,
      "stack_id": "s_02",
      "created_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00",
      "modified_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "c_33",
      "text": "Old rope",
      "position": {
        "x": 400.0,
        "y": 860
      },
      "color_slot": "slot_pink",
      "tags": [],
      "pinned": false,
      "stack_id": "s_02",
      "created_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00",
      "modified_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "c_34",
      "text": "The bartender had heard every version of that story at least twice.",
      "position": {
        "x": 400.0,
        "y": 860
      },
      "color_slot": "slot_purple",
      "tags": [],
      "pinned": false,
      "stack_id": "s_02",
      "created_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00",
      "modified_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "c_35",
      "text": "A single gull followed the boat for three days without ever landing.",
      "position": {
        "x": 400.0,
        "y": 860
      },
      "color_slot": "slot_gray",
      "tags": [],
      "pinned": false,
      "stack_id": "s_02",
      "created_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00",
      "modified_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "c_36",
      "text": "The chart showed a reef that hadn't existed on any map before it.",
      "position": {
        "x": 400.0,
        "y": 860
      },
      "color_slot": "slot_white",
      "tags": [],
      "pinned": false,
      "stack_id": "s_02",
      "created_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00",
      "modified_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "c_37",
      "text": "He never once mentioned the years he spent working the northern routes.",
      "position": {
        "x": 400.0,
        "y": 860
      },
      "color_slot": "slot_yellow",
      "tags": [],
      "pinned": false,
      "stack_id": "s_02",
      "created_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00",
      "modified_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00"
    },
    {
      "id": "c_38",
      "text": "Some nights the fog rolled in so thick the harbor lights disappeared entirely.",
      "position": {
        "x": 400.0,
        "y": 860
      },
      "color_slot": "slot_blue",
      "tags": [],
      "pinned": false,
      "stack_id": "s_02",
      "created_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00",
      "modified_at": "2026-08-30T09:43:20-04:00"
    }
  ],
